00:00:06,340 --> 00:00:07,774
Tyra: NEW YORK'S
TOP DESIGNERS

3
00:00:07,774 --> 00:00:10,077
LIKE MARC BOUWER
PUT THE GIRLS TO THE TEST...

4
00:00:10,077 --> 00:00:11,478
Marc: WHOOPS.

5
00:00:11,478 --> 00:00:12,880
Man: SHE WAS BUSTING OUT
OF THAT JACKET.

6
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:13,881
Woman:
WHAT ARE YOU GONNA DO?

7
00:00:13,881 --> 00:00:14,982
