STAY POSITIVE, AND IT'S HARD.

10
00:00:19,686 --> 00:00:21,054
Janice: HELLO.

11
00:00:21,054 --> 00:00:22,489
Nigel: THERE'S NO REASON
WHY YOU SHOULDN'T BE TAKING

12
00:00:22,489 --> 00:00:23,824
PHOTOGRAPHS LIKE THIS
