15
00:00:27,361 --> 00:00:28,529
THANKS, CASSIE.

16
00:00:28,529 --> 00:00:31,131
BUT IN THE END,
CASSIE WAS SENT HOME.

17
00:00:31,131 --> 00:00:32,466
SEVEN GIRLS REMAIN.

18
00:00:32,466 --> 00:00:34,968
WHO WILL BE ELIMINATED
