YOU'RE PERFECTION.

875
00:31:49,850 --> 00:31:51,385
I LIKE THE CONTRAST.

876
00:31:51,385 --> 00:31:54,188
I LIKE THE TORN JEANS
WITH THE SHIRT.

877
00:31:54,188 --> 00:31:55,990
LIKE, I'M FEELING
LIKE A STAR.

878
00:31:55,990 --> 00:31:57,591
HERE IS YOUR BEST SHOT.

879
