897
00:32:31,158 --> 00:32:32,893
YOU COULD TAKE THOSE
AND PUT THAT WITH THE SKIRT.

898
00:32:32,893 --> 00:32:34,061
Janice: YEAH, YEAH, YEAH,
THEY'RE OVER.

899
00:32:34,061 --> 00:32:35,129
Rebecca: YOU DON'T
REALLY GIVE A DAMN,

900
00:32:35,129 --> 00:32:36,464
