901
00:32:36,464 --> 00:32:38,032
Tyra:
HERE'S YOUR BEST SHOT.

902
00:32:38,032 --> 00:32:40,000
Nolé: YOU HAVE
A BEAUTIFUL-SHAPED FACE,

903
00:32:40,000 --> 00:32:42,770
BUT FOR SOME REASON, I'M JUST
NOT DRAWN TO IT.

904
00:32:42,770 --> 00:32:43,938
Nigel: I THINK
YOU'RE GORGEOUS,

905
00:32:43,938 --> 00:32:45,740
BUT IT'S MORE THAN
BEING GORGEOUS.

906
00:32:45,740 --> 00:32:48,542
IT'S ALSO ABOUT MODELING,
AND THIS ISN'T SO MUCH MODELING.

907
00:32:48,542 --> 00:32:50,911
THIS IS JUST BEING THERE
AND BEING GORGEOUS.

908
00:32:50,911 --> 00:32:52,747
