910
00:32:55,549 --> 00:32:56,617
Janice: ONLY ONE SHOT?

911
00:32:56,617 --> 00:32:58,919
Nolé: THAT IS
SO NOT GOOD, ANN.

912
00:32:58,919 --> 00:33:00,688
Tyra: NORELLE.

913
00:33:00,688 --> 00:33:02,656
Norelle: I THINK
THIS IS A CLASSIC HAT,

914
00:33:02,656 --> 00:33:04,525
BUT I FEEL LIKE I'M
A CLASSIC BEAUTY.

915
00:33:04,525 --> 00:33:05,960
Nigel: NORELLE,
I THINK THIS IS ACTUALLY

916
00:33:05,960 --> 00:33:07,361
