917
00:33:07,361 --> 00:33:09,163
- Norelle: THANK YOU.
- Nigel: YOU REALLY LOOK LOVELY.

918
00:33:09,163 --> 00:33:11,332
Nolé: YOU NEED TO LEARN
HOW TO WEAR THE CLOTHES.

919
00:33:11,332 --> 00:33:12,967
YOU NEED TO COME THROUGH.

920
00:33:12,967 --> 00:33:14,635
Rebecca: RED LIP
AND SOME ATTITUDE, I THINK,

921
00:33:14,635 --> 00:33:16,771
COULD HAVE TAKEN IT
TO THE NEXT LEVEL.

922
00:33:16,771 --> 00:33:18,973
Tyra:
HERE'S YOUR BEST SHOT.

923
00:33:18,973 --> 00:33:20,875
Nigel: GOT SOME POWER
IN YOUR EYES.

924
00:33:20,875 --> 00:33:23,144
