A LITTLE BIT MORE RELAXED.

925
00:33:23,144 --> 00:33:25,379
Tyra: YOUR MOUTH IS JUST
REALLY, REALLY TENSE,

926
00:33:25,379 --> 00:33:28,149
AND SOMETIMES IT'S
ABOUT PARTING IT A LITTLE,

927
00:33:28,149 --> 00:33:31,185
JUST OPEN A LITTLE BIT
TO TAKE THAT AWAY.

928
00:33:31,185 --> 00:33:33,821
ALL RIGHT, EVA, SO WHY DID YOU
CHOOSE THE MOTORCYCLE HAT?

929
00:33:33,821 --> 00:33:36,524
Eva: BECAUSE I LOVE LEATHER,
AND IT'S A LITTLE MORE EDGY,

930
00:33:36,524 --> 00:33:37,958
A LITTLE MORE RISQUE.

931
00:33:37,958 --> 00:33:39,927
Nigel: THAT DOES NOT LOOK
LIKE A MODEL AT ALL.

932
00:33:39,927 --> 00:33:41,429
IT LOOKS TOO CHEAP.

933
00:33:41,429 --> 00:33:42,863
Rebecca:
COMBINING THAT CUTE TOP

934
00:33:42,863 --> 00:33:45,399
WITH THAT SORT OF TRASHY
TYPE OF SKIRT--

935
00:33:45,399 --> 00:33:46,834
IT DOESN'T LOOK CHIC.

936
00:33:46,834 --> 00:33:48,669
IT KIND OF LOOKS LIKE
A GO-GO DANCER

937
00:33:48,669 --> 00:33:50,971
ON THE WAY HOME
FROM A NIGHT OUT.

938
00:33:50,971 --> 00:33:52,540
Tyra:
HERE'S YOUR BEST SHOT.

939
00:33:52,540 --> 00:33:55,075
- WOW.
- Janice: WORK IT!

940
00:33:55,075 --> 00:33:56,877
Nolé: IF I WAS LOOKING
AT THIS IN A MAGAZINE,

941
00:33:56,877 --> 00:33:58,479
I THINK YOU'VE TOTALLY
NAILED IT

942
00:33:58,479 --> 00:34:01,415
BECAUSE I'D WANNA KNOW
WHO THOSE RINGS WERE FROM.

943
00:34:01,415 --> 00:34:02,416
Janice:
I'M GIVING THIS A 10.

944
00:34:02,416 --> 00:34:03,417
Tyra: WHAT DO YOU THINK
ABOUT IT?

945
00:34:03,417 --> 00:34:04,718
I SAW YOU
TAKE YOUR BREATH AWAY.

946
