Eva: I AM AMAZED. I WAS
PETRIFIED OF THE SPIDER.

947
00:34:07,755 --> 00:34:09,623
Janice: TRY POSING
ON A LIVE CROCODILE, HONEY.

948
00:34:09,623 --> 00:34:11,625
Nigel: YOU KNOW, WELL DONE.
IT'S ABOUT GETTING THE SHOT.

949
00:34:11,625 --> 00:34:13,127
- Eva: THANK YOU.
- Tyra: YAYA.

950
00:34:13,127 --> 00:34:14,762
Yaya: EXCUSE ME.

951
00:34:14,762 --> 00:34:15,862
Tyra: WHY DID YOU CHOOSE
THE COWBOY HAT?

952
00:34:15,862 --> 00:34:17,598
Yaya: IT'S MORE
ON THE SIMPLE SIDE

953
00:34:17,598 --> 00:34:19,533
COMPARED TO THE OTHER HATS
SO THAT I CAN GO CRAZY

954
00:34:19,533 --> 00:34:21,068
WITH ACCESSORIES
AND EXPRESS MYSELF

955
00:34:21,068 --> 00:34:22,803
WITHOUT BEING CLICHE.

956
00:34:22,803 --> 00:34:24,338
Nigel: YAYA, I THINK
YOU LOOK BEAUTIFUL.

957
00:34:24,338 --> 00:34:25,473
I THINK EVERYONE
PROBABLY PEGGED YOU

958
00:34:25,473 --> 00:34:28,275
AS GOING FOR THE TYPICAL
AFRICAN HAT.

959
00:34:28,275 --> 00:34:32,146
Nolé: YAYA, I FEEL
HALF AFRICAN, HALF COWGIRL.

960
00:34:32,146 --> 00:34:34,315
LOOKS LIKE YOU'RE ABOUT
TO RIDE A GIRAFFE.

961
00:34:34,315 --> 00:34:36,484
I THINK--
I'M NOT FEELING IT.

962
00:34:36,484 --> 00:34:37,885
Rebecca: YOU HAVE
THIS INTENSITY TO PROVE

963
00:34:37,885 --> 00:34:39,219
YOUR SORT OF AFRICAN-NESS,

964
00:34:39,219 --> 00:34:41,655
AND I THINK THAT SOMETIMES
IT'S OVERBEARING.

965
00:34:41,655 --> 00:34:43,157
IT'S JUST TOO MUCH.

966
00:34:43,157 --> 00:34:44,958
IT'S SORT OF A LAYER
ON TOP OF A LAYER.

967
00:34:44,958 --> 00:34:48,661
Yaya: IN RESPONSE TO TRYING
TO PROVE MYSELF AS AN AFRICAN,

968
00:34:48,661 --> 00:34:49,697
THAT'S JUST
WHERE I COME FROM.

969
00:34:49,697 --> 00:34:51,065
IT'S VERY NATURAL TO ME,

970
00:34:51,065 --> 00:34:53,467
AND I DID NOT CHOOSE
THAT HAT

971
00:34:53,467 --> 00:34:56,637
FOR THE VERY SPECIFIC REASON
THAT IT'S VERY CLICHE.

972
00:34:56,637 --> 00:34:58,939
THE FABRIC
THAT IT'S MADE FROM

973
00:34:58,939 --> 00:35:01,709
IS VERY ARTIFICIAL,
VERY CHEAP, FAKE KENTE.

974
00:35:01,709 --> 00:35:03,944
- Nigel: YAYA...
- Yaya: I DIDN'T HAVE THE TIME--
I KNOW I'M RUNNING ON.

975
00:35:03,944 --> 00:35:05,379
Tyra: THERE'S A DIFFERENT WAY
OF EXPLAINING YOURSELF

976
00:35:05,379 --> 00:35:07,882
AND BEING DEFENSIVE, AND
YOU'RE BEING VERY DEFENSIVE,

977
00:35:07,882 --> 00:35:09,450
AND IT'S NOT ATTRACTIVE.

978
00:35:09,450 --> 00:35:11,619
Yaya: JUST BECAUSE WE HAD
A TALK ABOUT, YOU KNOW,

979
00:35:11,619 --> 00:35:14,388
"AFROCENTRICITY" BEFORE,
AND IT'S KIND OF...

980
00:35:14,388 --> 00:35:15,656
MISUNDERSTOOD.

981
00:35:15,656 --> 00:35:17,525
Tyra: I'M ALL ABOUT, LIKE,
EXPRESSING YOURSELF

982
00:35:17,525 --> 00:35:19,860
IN YOUR CULTURE, BUT IT'S
STILL DONE IN A FASHION WAY.

983
00:35:19,860 --> 00:35:21,929
YOU WANT YOUR OUTFIT TO BE
"LOOK AT ME!"

984
00:35:21,929 --> 00:35:24,732
AND THIS OUTFIT IS
"LOOK OVER THERE."

985
00:35:24,732 --> 00:35:26,534
HERE'S YOUR BEST SHOT.

986
00:35:26,534 --> 00:35:28,369
SEE, THAT'S A STAR, YAYA.

987
00:35:28,369 --> 00:35:30,804
- THEY WANNA LOOK AT... THAT.
- Janice: GORGEOUS!

988
00:35:30,804 --> 00:35:31,805
Nigel: THAT'S
THE BEST PICTURE OF ALL.

989
00:35:31,805 --> 00:35:33,140
Janice: THAT'S
SELLING JEWELRY.

990
00:35:33,140 --> 00:35:34,642
Tyra: YOU SEE HOW
INSPIRED THE PANEL IS

991
00:35:34,642 --> 00:35:36,176
- BY LOOKING AT THAT?
- Nigel: ABSOLUTELY.

992
00:35:36,176 --> 00:35:37,578
Tyra: IT'S BECAUSE
IT'S ASPIRATIONAL,

993
00:35:37,578 --> 00:35:39,647
AND IT'S VERY DIFFICULT
TO LOOK LIKE THAT.

994
00:35:39,647 --> 00:35:41,916
NOT EVERY GIRL ON
THE STREET CAN LOOK LIKE THAT.

995
00:35:41,916 --> 00:35:43,918
BUT EVERY GIRL ON THE STREET
CAN LOOK LIKE THIS.

996
00:35:43,918 --> 00:35:45,753
- Nolé: MM-HMM.
- Janice: THERE YOU GO.

997
00:35:45,753 --> 00:35:47,688
MODEL, MODEL, MODEL.

998
00:35:47,688 --> 00:35:48,856
Tyra: TOCCARA.

999
00:35:48,856 --> 00:35:50,324
Nigel: TOCCARA
HAS BECOME A SHELL.

1000
00:35:50,324 --> 00:35:52,459
SHE'S BECOME A GHOST OF
HER ORIGINAL SELF.

1001
00:35:52,459 --> 00:35:54,862
WHEN WE FIRST MET HER,
SHE HAD THIS MASSIVE

1002
00:35:54,862 --> 00:35:57,164
BUBBLY PERSONALITY WHICH
WENT ALONG WITH HER PHYSIQUE

1003
00:35:57,164 --> 00:36:00,334
AND EVERYTHING ELSE ABOUT HER,
AND NOW SHE JUST CHECKED OUT.

1004
00:36:00,334 --> 00:36:03,103
Nolé: TOCCARA IS
AN INCREDIBLY BEAUTIFUL GIRL.

1005
00:36:03,103 --> 00:36:04,605
SHE HAS A GREAT FACE,

1006
00:36:04,605 --> 00:36:06,640
AND WHEN YOU SHOOT HER,
IT'S FLAWLESS.

1007
00:36:06,640 --> 00:36:09,810
Tyra: TOCCARA HAS
THE POTENTIAL TO BE A STAR.

1008
00:36:09,810 --> 00:36:14,181
FOR SOME REASON, TODAY SHE
WALKED IN HERE AND GAVE UP.

1009
00:36:14,181 --> 00:36:16,383
- NORELLE.
- Nolé: IN THIS IMAGE,

1010
00:36:16,383 --> 00:36:18,118
I THINK THAT SHE WAS
REALLY TRYING.

1011
00:36:18,118 --> 00:36:21,021
I THINK SHE STILL
HASN'T MASTERED IT, THOUGH.

1012
00:36:21,021 --> 00:36:23,257
Tyra: IN PICTURES, I THINK SHE
DOES HAVE SOMETHING SPECIAL.

1013
00:36:23,257 --> 00:36:25,693
SHE'S PHOTOGENIC.
THE CAMERA LIKES HER FACE.

1014
00:36:25,693 --> 00:36:26,727
EVA.

1015
00:36:26,727 --> 00:36:28,862
Nolé: EVA SLAM-DUNKED
THIS SHOOT.

1016
00:36:28,862 --> 00:36:30,397
IT'S AN AMAZING IMAGE.

1017
00:36:30,397 --> 00:36:32,566
Janice: SHE'S FLAWLESS
EXCEPT FOR HER HANDS,

1018
00:36:32,566 --> 00:36:34,668
WHICH REALLY LOOK
LIKE BASEBALL MITTS.

1019
00:36:34,668 --> 00:36:35,869
Tyra: YAYA.

1020
00:36:35,869 --> 00:36:38,572
Janice: THIS GIRL
IS AN AD CAMPAIGN WINNER.

1021
00:36:38,572 --> 00:36:39,974
Nolé: AND IN THIS PHOTO,
IT'S KIND OF LIKE

1022
