1023
00:36:42,076 --> 00:36:44,979
Tyra: YAYA TAKES A BEAUTIFUL
PICTURE EFFORTLESSLY.

1024
00:36:44,979 --> 00:36:47,247
SHE'S BRINGING
SOMETHING FROM INSIDE.

1025
00:36:47,247 --> 00:36:49,016
BUT THE OTHER THING THAT
YAYA BRINGS FROM INSIDE

1026
00:36:49,016 --> 00:36:52,119
THAT IS SO UGLY
IS THAT SUPERIORITY,

1027
00:36:52,119 --> 00:36:54,421
CONDESCENDING ATTITUDE.

1028
00:36:54,421 --> 00:36:55,856
- Janice: OOPS.
- Tyra: NICOLE.

1029
00:36:55,856 --> 00:36:58,025
Janice: IS SUPPOSED TO BE
SELLING BEAUTIFUL JEWELRY,

1030
00:36:58,025 --> 00:37:00,694
AND SHE DIDN'T PULL IT OFF
IN THIS PICTURE.

1031
00:37:00,694 --> 00:37:02,329
Tyra: NICOLE DOES TAKE
REALLY BEAUTIFUL PICTURES,

1032
00:37:02,329 --> 00:37:04,732
BUT A LOT OF THE TIMES TO ME,
IT'S JUST A BEAUTIFUL PICTURE.

1033
00:37:04,732 --> 00:37:07,901
I'M NOT SURE SHE HAS ANYTHING
THAT REALLY CAN READ AS A STAR

1034
00:37:07,901 --> 00:37:09,403
IN TERMS OF PERSONALITY.

1035
00:37:09,403 --> 00:37:10,437
ANN.

1036
00:37:10,437 --> 00:37:11,739
Nigel: ANN SEEMS TO BE
ALMOST INCAPABLE

1037
00:37:11,739 --> 00:37:13,007
