A GOOD PICTURE.

1038
00:37:13,007 --> 00:37:15,409
Rebecca: SHE'S NOT INTERESTED
IN HER SELF-IMAGE.

1039
00:37:15,409 --> 00:37:18,078
SHE DOESN'T GIVE A DAMN,
AND IT SHOWED TONIGHT.

1040
00:37:18,078 --> 00:37:20,047
Nolé: I THINK ANN'S RUN
IS OVER FOR ME.

1041
00:37:20,047 --> 00:37:21,849
- SHE'S OUT.
- Tyra: AMANDA.

1042
00:37:21,849 --> 00:37:23,617
Janice: AMANDA IS DEAD
IN THIS PHOTOGRAPH.

1043
00:37:23,617 --> 00:37:25,185
THERE'S NOTHING
COMING THROUGH THE EYES.

1044
00:37:25,185 --> 00:37:26,720
Tyra: I THINK AMANDA'S
RESTING ON PRETTY.

1045
00:37:26,720 --> 00:37:30,024
SHE NEEDS TO STEP UP HER GAME,
OR ELSE SHE'LL GO BYE-BYE.

1046
00:37:30,024 --> 00:37:31,625
Janice: BYE-BYE.

1047
00:37:35,029 --> 00:37:38,399
Tyra: THERE ARE SEVEN
BEAUTIFUL YOUNG LADIES

1048
00:37:38,399 --> 00:37:40,534
STANDING IN FRONT OF ME,

1049
00:37:40,534 --> 00:37:42,970
BUT I ONLY HAVE SIX PHOTOS
IN MY HANDS,

1050
00:37:42,970 --> 00:37:44,672
AND THESE PHOTOS
REPRESENT THE SIX OF YOU

1051
00:37:44,672 --> 00:37:46,740
THAT WILL STILL BE
IN THE RUNNING

1052
00:37:46,740 --> 00:37:49,343
TOWARDS BECOMING
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

1053
00:37:49,343 --> 00:37:52,846
FIRST NAME THAT
I'M GOING TO CALL...

1054
00:37:52,846 --> 00:37:54,581
NICOLE.

1055
00:37:54,581 --> 00:37:56,550
Nicole: WOW.

1056
00:37:56,550 --> 00:37:58,185
Tyra: CONGRATULATIONS.

1057
00:37:58,185 --> 00:37:59,286
YOU'RE STILL IN THE RUNNING

1058
00:37:59,286 --> 00:38:00,788
TOWARDS BECOMING
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

1059
00:38:00,788 --> 00:38:02,523
Nicole: THANK YOU.

1060
00:38:02,523 --> 00:38:03,524
Tyra: EVA.

1061
00:38:05,025 --> 00:38:06,360
I WANNA COMMEND YOU
ON THIS PHOTO

1062
00:38:06,360 --> 00:38:08,095
BECAUSE YOU SAID
THAT YOU WERE CRYING.

1063
00:38:08,095 --> 00:38:10,798
I CANNOT SEE THIS
ON THAT PICTURE.

1064
00:38:10,798 --> 00:38:12,633
- GOOD JOB.
- Eva: THANK YOU.

1065
00:38:12,633 --> 00:38:13,967
Tyra: AMANDA.

1066
00:38:15,969 --> 00:38:19,506
AMANDA, THIS LOOK
IS RED CARPET STAR,

1067
00:38:19,506 --> 00:38:22,676
BUT THIS PICTURE
IS LUKEWARM.

1068
00:38:23,711 --> 00:38:26,046
YAYA.

1069
00:38:26,046 --> 00:38:28,248
YAYA, THIS PICTURE
IS STUNNING.

1070
00:38:28,248 --> 00:38:30,084
I MEAN, THIS IS AMAZING.

1071
00:38:30,084 --> 00:38:33,220
BUT WHAT'S NOT AMAZING
IS YOUR APPEARANCE.

1072
00:38:33,220 --> 00:38:35,756
THINK A LITTLE BIT MORE GLAMOUR
AS OPPOSED TO NATURAL,

1073
00:38:35,756 --> 00:38:38,559
'CAUSE THIS IS GLAMOROUS,
AND THIS IS AMAZING.

1074
00:38:38,559 --> 00:38:40,594
CONGRATULATIONS.
YOU'RE STILL IN THE RUNNING

1075
00:38:40,594 --> 00:38:42,529
TOWARDS BECOMING AMERICA'S
NEXT TOP MODEL.

1076
00:38:42,529 --> 00:38:43,931
Yaya: THANK YOU,
AND I JUST WANTED TO SAY

1077
00:38:43,931 --> 00:38:45,666
I'M SORRY FOR BEING DEFENSIVE
WHEN YOU GAVE ME--

1078
00:38:45,666 --> 00:38:47,668
I TOTALLY TOOK IN
EVERYTHING YOU SAID.

1079
00:38:47,668 --> 00:38:49,069
AND I REALLY MEAN IT.

1080
00:38:49,069 --> 00:38:50,871
I WAS SO OUTSIDE
OF MYSELF.

1081
00:38:50,871 --> 00:38:52,139
Tyra: WELL,
THAT WAS THE OTHER CRITIQUE

1082
00:38:52,139 --> 00:38:53,841
THAT I WAS GONNA GIVE YOU
THAT I FORGOT,

1083
00:38:53,841 --> 00:38:55,008
SO COME RIGHT BACK.

1084
00:38:55,008 --> 00:38:56,343
YOU NEED TO APOLOGIZE

1085
00:38:56,343 --> 00:38:59,513
TO THE FAKE KENTE CLOTH
AFRICAN HAT.

1086
00:38:59,513 --> 00:39:01,749
YAYA, IT WAS LIKE
YOU WERE ON THIS PEDESTAL,

1087
00:39:01,749 --> 00:39:04,384
AND THIS HAT SMELLED
LIKE DOOKIE.

1088
00:39:04,384 --> 00:39:07,621
YOU'RE INSULTING THE PERSON
THAT CHOSE THAT HAT.

1089
00:39:07,621 --> 00:39:09,289
ALL YOU HAD TO DO WAS SAY,
"NO, THAT WASN'T MY STYLE.

1090
00:39:09,289 --> 00:39:10,491
IT WAS A LITTLE OBVIOUS."

1091
00:39:10,491 --> 00:39:12,559
IT WAS VERY INSULTING,
AND IN THIS INDUSTRY,

1092
00:39:12,559 --> 00:39:15,129
THERE'S GONNA BE PEOPLE
THAT REALLY ARE SENSITIVE,

1093
00:39:15,129 --> 00:39:17,664
AND WORD WILL SPREAD, AND NO ONE
WILL EVER WANNA WORK WITH YOU.

1094
00:39:17,664 --> 00:39:19,633
Yaya: I UNDERSTAND THAT,
AND I APOLOGIZE.

1095
00:39:19,633 --> 00:39:21,335
Tyra: NORELLE.

1096
00:39:23,670 --> 00:39:26,273
FOR SOMEONE THAT IS LOOKING
SO SURPRISED AND SHOCKED,

1097
00:39:26,273 --> 00:39:28,375
YOU SURE DID HAVE
A NICE SMILE ON YOUR FACE.

1098
00:39:28,375 --> 00:39:29,777
Norelle: I'M JUST BLESSED
TO BE HERE AND--

1099
00:39:29,777 --> 00:39:31,512
Tyra: BLESSED TO BE HERE AND
THOUGHT YOU WERE GOING HOME,

1100
00:39:31,512 --> 00:39:33,514
SO YOU'RE GONNA PUT A SMILE
ON YOUR FACE.

1101
00:39:33,514 --> 00:39:34,782
CONGRATULATIONS.

1102
00:39:34,782 --> 00:39:36,049
Norelle:
THANK YOU VERY MUCH.

1103
00:39:38,218 --> 00:39:39,686
Tyra: WILL TOCCARA AND ANN
PLEASE STEP FORWARD?

1104
00:39:43,624 --> 00:39:45,492
I HAVE ONE PHOTO
IN MY HANDS,

1105
00:39:45,492 --> 00:39:47,394
AND THIS ONE PHOTO
REPRESENTS THE GIRL

1106
00:39:47,394 --> 00:39:48,695
THAT WILL CONTINUE ON
IN THE RUNNING

1107
00:39:48,695 --> 00:39:50,831
TOWARDS BECOMING
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

1108
00:39:50,831 --> 00:39:52,466
THE GIRL THAT I DO NOT CALL

1109
00:39:52,466 --> 00:39:55,335
MUST IMMEDIATELY
RETURN TO THE APARTMENT,

1110
00:39:55,335 --> 00:39:58,472
PACK YOUR BELONGINGS
AND LEAVE.

1111
00:39:58,472 --> 00:40:01,675
THE MODELING INDUSTRY
IS NOT JUST ABOUT BEAUTY.

1112
00:40:01,675 --> 00:40:03,443
IT'S ABOUT DRIVE.

1113
00:40:03,443 --> 00:40:07,481
TOCCARA, I KNEW FROM DAY ONE
THAT YOU WANTED THIS,

1114
00:40:07,481 --> 00:40:11,685
THAT THIS WAS SOMETHING
THAT YOU LIVED AND BREATHED

1115
00:40:11,685 --> 00:40:14,154
AND WAS F-A-B-O,

1116
00:40:14,154 --> 00:40:18,592
"I AM FABULOUS AND
I WANT THIS SO BAD."

1117
00:40:18,592 --> 00:40:22,596
ANN, I SAW A COMPETITOR
IN YOU.

1118
00:40:22,596 --> 00:40:25,999
I SAW SOMEONE
THAT WANTS TO WIN,

1119
00:40:25,999 --> 00:40:27,267
SOMEONE THAT'S LIKE,
"YOU KNOW WHAT?

1120
00:40:27,267 --> 00:40:29,036
I MIGHT NOT BE
GREAT AT THIS,

1121
00:40:29,036 --> 00:40:30,904
BUT I'M-A CONQUER
THIS DAMN THING."

1122
00:40:30,904 --> 00:40:36,376
RIGHT NOW NEITHER OF YOU
LOOK LIKE MODELS.

1123
00:40:36,376 --> 00:40:40,514
NEITHER OF YOU EVEN LOOK
LIKE MODELS IN THE MAKING.

1124
00:40:40,514 --> 00:40:43,650
YOU BOTH FAILED
MISERABLY.

1125
00:40:43,650 --> 00:40:45,552
WE CAN'T SEND
TWO OF YOU HOME,

1126
00:40:45,552 --> 00:40:46,920
'CAUSE MAYBE ONE OF YOU
WANTS IT

1127
00:40:46,920 --> 00:40:48,288
A LITTLE BIT
MORE THAN THE OTHER.

1128
00:40:53,393 --> 00:40:55,395
ANN.

1129
00:40:55,395 --> 00:40:57,497
CONGRATULATIONS.

1130
00:40:57,497 --> 00:40:59,266
YOU'RE STILL IN THE RUNNING
TOWARDS BECOMING

1131
00:40:59,266 --> 00:41:01,168
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

1132
00:41:01,168 --> 00:41:02,436
THANK YOU, TOCCARA.

1133
00:41:02,436 --> 00:41:04,171
Toccara: THANK YOU.

1134
00:41:04,171 --> 00:41:06,607
- Janice: GOOD LUCK, TOCCARA.
- Nolé: GOOD LUCK, TOCCARA.

1135
00:41:06,607 --> 00:41:08,041
Toccara: BYE, MAMA!

1136
00:41:10,510 --> 00:41:12,913
Amanda: YOU'RE SO AWESOME.

1137
00:41:12,913 --> 00:41:15,849
Toccara:
BYE, GUYS. WORK IT!

1138
00:41:19,519 --> 00:41:21,521
Toccara: I HONESTLY BELIEVE
THAT I SHOULD BE HERE

1139
00:41:21,521 --> 00:41:24,992
FOR THE FINAL THREE,
BUT I'M PROUD OF MYSELF.

1140
00:41:24,992 --> 00:41:27,060
I'M THE LARGEST GIRL
TO GET HERE,

1141
00:41:27,060 --> 00:41:28,595
AND I MADE IT THIS FAR.

1142
00:41:28,595 --> 00:41:30,597
SOMEONE HAS TO START
TO BREAK THE BARRIER,

1143
00:41:30,597 --> 00:41:32,799
SO HOPEFULLY THE NEXT PLUS-SIZED
GIRL THAT COMES ALONG--

1144
00:41:32,799 --> 00:41:35,068
SHE MAKES IT
A LITTLE BIT FURTHER.

1145
00:41:35,068 --> 00:41:37,404
IT'S GONNA TAKE TIME.
IT DOESN'T HAPPEN OVERNIGHT.

1146
00:41:37,404 --> 00:41:40,107
BUT I'M JUST GRATEFUL THAT
MAYBE I MADE A PATH

1147
00:41:40,107 --> 00:41:41,708
FOR SOMEONE ELSE.

1148
00:41:54,221 --> 00:41:56,634
Tyra: STAY TUNED FOR SCENES
FROM OUR NEXT EPISODE.

1149
00:42:00,127 --> 00:42:02,830
HERE'S WHAT'S COMING UP ON
"AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL"...

1150
00:42:02,830 --> 00:42:05,165
Yaya: AM I SAYING
THESE THINGS TO BE COCKY?

1151
00:42:05,165 --> 00:42:08,035
Tyra: YAYA'S WINNING STREAK
BECOMES AN ISSUE IN THE HOUSE.

1152
00:42:08,035 --> 00:42:10,270
Norelle: JUST BECAUSE
YOU WON THREE CHALLENGES

1153
00:42:10,270 --> 00:42:11,572
DOESN'T MEAN
YOU'RE GONNA WIN,

1154
00:42:11,572 --> 00:42:13,574
AND I DON'T THINK IN ANY WAY
IS THAT AN ADVANTAGE.

1155
00:42:13,574 --> 00:42:16,009
Tyra: THEN THERE'S A CLASS
WITH AN ACTOR TO DIE FOR...

1156
00:42:16,009 --> 00:42:17,611
Eva: TAYE DIGGS!

1157
00:42:17,611 --> 00:42:19,913
Tyra: AND A NURSE WITH
A SPECIAL ANNOUNCEMENT.

1158
00:42:19,913 --> 00:42:22,382
PACK YOUR BAGS, GIRLS,
'CAUSE YOU'RE GOING TO...

1159
00:42:22,382 --> 00:42:23,951
Women: AAH!

